WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7403842Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7415713Z ^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7416362Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7416870Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7417308Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7417817Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7419019Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7419574Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7419932Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7421020Z    if you are ready to continue.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7421457Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7422364Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7423516Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7424392Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7425165Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7425612Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7425978Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7426510Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7426892Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7427592Z    can use Nix.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7427865Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7428060Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7428357Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7428874Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7429742Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7430157Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7430419Z I will:
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7430690Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7431370Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7432150Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7432940Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7433658Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7434185Z  - install Nix in /nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7434691Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7435438Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7436127Z    /root
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7446128Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7447009Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7458352Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:28:24.7459329Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
